# NEVER commit private signing key material. The matching PUBLIC key is
# embedded (and committed) in src/pubkey.rs — public by design.
# See docs/self-updater-design.md → "Key management".
*.key
*.sec
*.pem
secret*
signing-key*
# The real generated public key file (its base64 is already baked into
# src/pubkey.rs — no need to also commit the loose file) and the local-only
# key notes (which may name the passphrase) stay out of the repo too.
wylde-signing.pub
KEY_NOTES.md
# but keep the format example
!pubkey.pub.example
